sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Creator
    participant UI as Web dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI service
    participant F as Feature builder
    participant M as Random forest + SHAP
    participant S as Feedback store
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/health (every 5 s)
    API-->>UI: 200 {status: ok, model_version}
    C->>UI: pick product, Load 45-day history
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/samples/{id}
    API-->>UI: 200 request body
    C->>UI: Predict
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/predict (JSON)
    alt invalid body or too little history
        API-->>UI: 400 / 415 / 422 {error}
        UI-->>C: show code + message
    else model not loaded
        API-->>UI: 503 MODEL_NOT_READY + Retry-After
    else valid
        API->>F: features_for_single_product(history, product)
        F-->>API: 1 row, 28 features
        API->>M: predict_proba + TreeExplainer
        M-->>API: probability, SHAP values
        API-->>UI: 200 {prediction, reasons, latency_ms}
        UI-->>C: label, probability bar, reasons
    end
    C->>UI: Useful / Not useful / It did not surge
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/feedback
    API->>S: append JSON line
    API-->>UI: 201 {feedback_id}
